# Unsaved Save is orange

Any owner-edit Save (Save period, Save week, Confirm Plan, Confirm) uses `className="is-unsaved"` while that screen is dirty. CSS is `button.is-unsaved` in App.css. Do not add a second Save.

Export and snapshot Save stay unchanged.

Leaving that screen, or restarting, while the dirty flag is true must ask first. Do not drop the edits.
